    description = $c$A V-Bucks card tops up your V-Bucks balance in Fortnite. V-Bucks buy outfits, emotes and the battle pass.

The card is tied to a country. It redeems only if your Epic Games account, or your platform account such as PlayStation Network, is registered in that same country. Pick your account's country in the switcher above.

V-Bucks redeemed on PlayStation, Xbox, PC or mobile are shared across those platforms. V-Bucks redeemed on Nintendo can only be spent on Nintendo.$c$,
